OL,3,GNEWSAIsland's storm response gets
OL,4,Anational attention
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo members of an island's response to
OL,7,FStorm Goretti have told of their
OL,8,F"fascinating" experience taking
OL,9,Fquestions from a national audience of
OL,10,Ftree experts.
OL,12,FAndy McCutcheon, the principal
OL,13,Fenvironment services officer at the
OL,14,FStates of Guernsey, and Hugo Ciotti, an
OL,15,Farboricultural consultant, took part in
OL,16,Fthe National Tree Officers' Conference,
OL,17,Fin Sheffield, England, earlier in
OL,18,FNovember.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,443,440,260,160,0,100
