OL,3,GNEWSAIsland's storm response gets
OL,4,Anational attention
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe pair's presentation walked through
OL,7,FGuernsey's storm damage response and
OL,8,Fwhat it was like on the front line,
OL,9,Fclearing roads to help people.
OL,11,FCiotti said there was "no shortage of
OL,12,Finterest" from the 200 attendees, who
OL,13,Fhe said saw Guernsey as "a test bed in
OL,14,Fresponding to storms" due to its
OL,15,Fgeography.
